{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_73","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat agent/BUDGET.md && cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration 2 follow-up: test the mixture on the new stress windows, retaining Gaussian innovations for crypto24h. The first selection is based on horizon/group behavior, not per-asset cherry-picking. The full candidate still needs an independent-seed comparison later.\nEOF\nuv run agent/run_suite.py --tag stress_mixture --model research_model --days 3 --ends 2026-09-13 2026-09-19 2026-10-05 --workers 2 --config '{\\\"seasonal\\\":true,\\\"mix\\\":0.35,\\\"mix_scope\\\":\\\"non_crypto24h\\\"}' > agent/results/stress_mixture_suite.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
